"#cite_ref-4\">^</a></b></span> <span class=\"reference-text\"><link rel=\"mw-deduplicated-inline-style\" href=\"mw-data:TemplateStyles:r1333433106\" /><cite id=\"CITEREFMaher2025\" class=\"citation web cs1\">Maher, Kit (January 9, 2025). <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://www.cnn.com/2025/01/09/politics/jd-vance-ohio-senate-seat-resign-vice-president/index.html\">\"Vance resigning Senate seat effective at midnight\"</a>. CNN<span class=\"reference-accessdate\">. Retrieved <span class=\"nowrap\">January 9,</span> 2025</span>.</cite><span title=\"ctx&#95;ver=Z39.88-2004&amp;rft&#95;val&#95;fmt=info%3Aofi%2Ffmt%3Akev%3Amtx%3Abook&amp;rft.genre=unknown&amp;rft.btitle=Vance+resigning+Senate+seat+effective+at+midnight&amp;rft.pub=CNN&amp;rft.date=2025-01-09&amp;rft.aulast=Maher&amp;rft.aufirst=Kit&amp;rft&#95;id=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.cnn.com%2F2025%2F01%2F09%2Fpolitics%2Fjd-vance-ohio-senate-seat-resign-vice-president%2Findex.html&amp;rfr&#95;id=info%3Asid%2Fen.wikipedia.org%3A119th+United+States+Congress\" class=\"Z3988\"></span></span>\n</li>\n<li id=\"cite&#95;note-5\"><span class=\"mw-cite-backlink\"><b><a href=\"#cite_ref-5\">^</a></b></span> <span class=\"reference-text\"><link rel=\"mw-deduplicated-inline-style\" href=\"mw-data:TemplateStyles:r1333433106\" /><cite class=\"citation web cs1\"><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://www.reviewonline.com/opinion/local-columns/2024/11/replacing-vance-in-senate-will-be-dewines-decision/\">\"Replacing Vance in Senate will be DeWine's decision\"</a>. <i>The Review</i>. <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://web.archive.org/web/20241127081906/https://www.reviewonline.com/opinion/local-columns/2024/11/replacing-vance-in-senate-will-be-dewines-decision/\">Archived</a> from the original on November 27, 2024<span class=\"reference-accessdate\">. Retrieved <span class=\"nowrap\">November 18,</span> 2024</span>.</cite><span title=\"ctx&#95;ver=Z39.88-2004&amp;rft&#95;val