25\" class=\"citation web cs1\">Crowley, Michael (January 20, 2025). <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://www.nytimes.com/2025/01/20/us/politics/marco-rubio-confirmed-secretary-of-state.html\">\"Marco Rubio Is Confirmed by Senate as Secretary of State\"</a>. <i>The New York Times</i>. <a href=\"/wiki/ISSN_(identifier)\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"ISSN (identifier)\">ISSN</a>&#160;<a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://search.worldcat.org/issn/0362-4331\">0362-4331</a><span class=\"reference-accessdate\">. Retrieved <span class=\"nowrap\">January 21,</span> 2025</span>.</cite><span title=\"ctx&#95;ver=Z39.88-2004&amp;rft&#95;val&#95;fmt=info%3Aofi%2Ffmt%3Akev%3Amtx%3Ajournal&amp;rft.genre=unknown&amp;rft.jtitle=The+New+York+Times&amp;rft.atitle=Marco+Rubio+Is+Confirmed+by+Senate+as+Secretary+of+State&amp;rft.date=2025-01-20&amp;rft.issn=0362-4331&amp;rft.aulast=Crowley&amp;rft.aufirst=Michael&amp;rft&#95;id=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.nytimes.com%2F2025%2F01%2F20%2Fus%2Fpolitics%2Fmarco-rubio-confirmed-secretary-of-state.html&amp;rfr&#95;id=info%3Asid%2Fen.wikipedia.org%3A119th+United+States+Congress\" class=\"Z3988\"></span></span>\n</li>\n<li id=\"cite&#95;note-8\"><span class=\"mw-cite-backlink\"><b><a href=\"#cite_ref-8\">^</a></b></span> <span class=\"reference-text\"><link rel=\"mw-deduplicated-inline-style\" href=\"mw-data:TemplateStyles:r1333433106\" /><cite class=\"citation web cs1\"><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://apnews.com/article/us-senate-florida-rubio-desantis-trump-appointment-49e3d490a298b64470c69d1892efc1b8\">\"DeSantis aims to appoint Marco Rubio's Senate replacement by early January\"</a>. APnews. November 18, 2024. <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://web.archive.org/web/20241119022504/https://apnews.com/article/us-senate-florida-rubio-desantis-trump-appointment-49e3d490a298b64470c69d1892efc1b8\">Archived</a> from the original on November 19, 2024<span class=\"ref